@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 外观模式：前端 API 封装对页面提供统一访问入口

package "页面层" {
  class HomeView
  class ActivityListView
  class CalendarView
}

package "业务 API 外观" {
  class RecommendationsApiFacade
  class ActivitiesApiFacade
  class SchedulesApiFacade
}

class HttpClient
class BackendApi {
  /api/v1/*
}

HomeView --> RecommendationsApiFacade
ActivityListView --> ActivitiesApiFacade
CalendarView --> SchedulesApiFacade

RecommendationsApiFacade --> HttpClient
ActivitiesApiFacade --> HttpClient
SchedulesApiFacade --> HttpClient
HttpClient --> BackendApi

note bottom of HttpClient
统一设置 baseURL、注入 Bearer Token、
并解包 response.data。
end note
@enduml
